:''Not to be confused with [[Rin Tohsaka (Uber Rare Cat)]].''
'''Rin the Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event/Gacha Drop|Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel]] collaboration gacha event. She was added in [[Version 6.6 Update|Version 6.6]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 371
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Rin the Cat
|name2 = Mage Rin Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Mage Rin Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Despite her high proc chance, Rin the Cat has many flaws making her a poor crowd-control unit. Foremost, she has [[Single Attack]], making her difficult to use against groups of [[General GreGory|General GreGories]] and [[Star Peng]]s who would sometimes warrant the use of [[Knockback|Knockback]]. Even then, Knockback tends to fare badly against Aliens as they usually come with backliners. [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Psychocat]] and [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Surfer Cat]] remain staples of Alien crowd-control and function as such better than Rin the Cat could. If you would ever want to knock back Aliens for any reason, [[Ancient Egg: N105 (Rare Cat)|Racquet Cat]], unlike Rin the Cat, has the [[Area Attack]] and pierce to do so effectively.

